    "identifier": "kaguya-dance-of-the-larch",
    "description": "<p>You extract bones to a greater degree, allowing them to stick out in a variety of positions, creating a makeshift lethal but protective armor. You gain 12 temporary hit points. If a creature hits you with a melee attack while you have these hit points, the creature takes 8 piercing damage that ignores DR.</p>\n<p>Battle Lust: By spending 1 Battle Lust when a creature takes damage from this jutsu, they must make a Constitution saving throw gaining a rank of Bleed on a failure.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the temporary hit points by +8 and piercing damage by +4.</p>",
